hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1663","Narrated to us Yusuf ibn Musa, narrated to us Jarir, on the authority of Abu Ishaq al-Shaybani, on the authority of Adi ibn Thabit, on the authority of Zirr ibn Hubaysh, on the authority of Hudhayfah (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, \Whoever spits towards the Qiblah will come on the Day of Resurrection with his spit between his eyes. And whoever eats from this foul plant (garlic)"","" let him not approach our mosque.\""\n\n\n\nCHAPTER:"""""
